bound. A\\n  role with no configured default keeps explicit selection mandatory. Inspect\\n  what a role resolves to before spawning with:\\n    task-board q 'project_config(view=spawn-preflight, role=ROLE, agent=PROVIDER)'\\n  Inspect the current registry with: task-board q 'models(agent=codex)'\\n\\n  With model_criterion less_or_equal or greater_or_equal, every spawn also\\n  requires --selection-rationale with one non-empty line explaining the chosen\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3467,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 867,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
