nd is applied to 3 surfaces (manifest registries via TestManifestRegistriesAreDerivedFromSpec - MA17 duly killed; keyed operations; the 7.7 profile table). All 8 enums are stated verbatim in th\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 12001,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 3001,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
